# Legal pages are GENERATED from /legal/*.md by web/scripts/build-legal.mjs at build time.
# Never commit them: two copies of a legal promise is exactly how the published page and the
# document a human reviews drift apart (LEGAL-IMPLEMENTATION §7). The markdown is the source.
web/public/privacy.html
web/public/terms.html
web/public/refunds.html
web/public/contact.html
